OL,3,A'You're not alone in the darkness':
OL,4,AGambia president urges calm after
OL,5,Aviolent blackout protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Gambia's President Adama Barrow has
OL,8,Furged citizens to remain calm over
OL,9,Fprolonged power cuts, saying the
OL,10,Fcountry is not alone in facing an
OL,11,Felectricity crisis that has affected
OL,12,Fseveral parts of West Africa.
OL,14,FHis comments follow protests on Monday
OL,15,Fnight in the capital Banjul and
OL,16,Fsurrounding areas over blackouts that
OL,17,Fresidents say have sometimes lasted up
OL,18,Fto 48 hours.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
