OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'You're not alone in the darkness':
OL,4,AGambia president urges calm after
OL,5,Aviolent blackout protests
OL,6,
OL,7,F"When you lie down in the heat and the
OL,8,Fdark, believe that you are not alone in
OL,9,Fthat darkness," Barrow said, pledging
OL,10,Fto boost power supplies by next month.
OL,12,FThe Gambia supplements its own
OL,13,Fgeneration with imported electricity,
OL,14,Fincluding supplies from Guinea and
OL,15,Fneighbouring Senegal.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
